---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Compliance"
  description="AIB Robot is an 18+ specialist retailer: no child-like or anime figures, no shipping to prohibited regions, and no customs misdeclaration, including Mid-East grey-customs arrangements."
  requireAge={false}
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <p class="kicker">Legal</p>
      <h1>Compliance, stated as a rule.</h1>
      <p class="lead">This page is a set of limits, not a marketing statement. If a request conflicts with it, we will refuse the request.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose" style="padding-bottom:4.5rem">
      <p class="fine">Last updated 12 November 2026.</p>

      <h2>Adults only</h2>
      <p>
        Every product on this site is for adults, 18 years of age or older. We ask you to confirm your age before product photography is shown, and again when you submit an inquiry. We will not sell to anyone we believe is under 18.
      </p>

      <h2>No child-like, petite-coded, or anime figures</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, and we will not source, figures that are child-like, that are styled as children, or that belong to cartoon or anime lines. The collection on this site is adult-realistic only, at 157 cm and above. We do not provide filters or categories for shorter bodies. The AI figure in this collection is the 164 cm expression head. Several US states already prohibit child-like dolls, and a retailer’s decision not to carry them does not depend on waiting for a further statute. We will refuse inquiries that ask us to go around this rule.
      </p>

      <h2>No shipping where the product is prohibited</h2>
      <p>
        You are responsible for knowing the law in the place a package would be received. We will not ship to a jurisdiction where the import or possession of these products is prohibited. That includes destinations that ban adult companion figures as such. If we learn that a destination is prohibited, we will cancel the request rather than force a shipment.
      </p>

      <h2>No customs misdeclaration — including Mid-East grey customs</h2>
      <p>
        We will not misdeclare the contents of a shipment. We will not describe a companion figure as a mannequin, a display model, a toy, or any other inaccurate category in order to clear customs. We will not participate in a grey-customs or under-declaration arrangement, including arrangements of that kind associated with Middle East routes or any other route. If a destination can only be served by such a method, we will not serve it.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising, platforms, and payment</h2>
      <p>
        Adult companion products are restricted on many advertising networks, some hosted-commerce platforms, and many ordinary payment processors. This site is an independent storefront. Checkout is an order request; card payment is arranged only after a high-risk processor is approved, and only after inventory and the final price are confirmed. We do not put a decorative PayPal or Stripe button on a page that cannot actually take a lawful payment for these goods.
      </p>

      <h2>Product claims</h2>
      <p>
        Specifications, prices, and warehouse notes on this site are taken from the notes named on each product page. We do not invent measurements, sale badges, or stock counts. We do not promise features those notes do not support — including walking, or reliable operation of an expression head on US or EU home Wi-Fi.
      </p>

      <h2>Independence</h2>
      <p>
        AIB Robot sells the figures described on this site. We do not present this website as a manufacturer’s store, and we do not claim a status we have not earned. Companion figures here are transitional products beside a longer-term category of AI bionic robots.
      </p>

      <p>
        Questions about this policy can be sent through the <a href="/contact">contact form</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
